LRAGN,	JMS I	[CHKUP]		/CHECK FOR <^P>, ETC.
	JMS I	[IOHAND]	/CALL I/O HANDLER
	LABUFFER		/LABEL BUFFER
LRECFUN,2^100+.-.		/UNIT BITS WILL BE FILLED IN
